# PDF documents (Golf Sol Ireland)

PDFs fall into three buckets: **server-generated** (brand-aligned `pdf-lib` + shared letterhead), **browser-generated** (`pdf-lib` / `jspdf` / print-to-PDF), and **admin-supplied** (uploaded PDFs attached to Resend — not generated in this repo).

## Master stationery (required for customer PDFs)

One full-company letterhead is the shell for **enquiries, quotations, booking confirmations, invoices, deposit receipts, payment receipts, and paid-in-full receipts**:

- Crest **left**, company name, tagline, Dublin address, Ireland + Spain phones, email, website, Co. **814210**, gold rule.
- White A4, gold top bar, matching footer (company line + page X of Y).
- Source of truth for company copy: `CLIENT_DOCUMENT_COMPANY` in [client-enquiry-document.mjs](mdc:shared/client-enquiry-document.mjs).

**Do not** add a new dark forest header band for customer documents. The old emerald-band unified header is retired.

### Helpers

| Module | Use |
|--------|-----|
| [gsol-unified-pdf-template.mjs](mdc:server/gsol-unified-pdf-template.mjs) | `drawUnifiedDocumentHeader` / `drawUnifiedDocumentFooter` / tables / paragraphs. Pass `{ compact: true }` on continuation pages. |
| [gsol-master-document-pdf.mjs](mdc:server/gsol-master-document-pdf.mjs) | One-page invoices and receipts: `buildGsolMasterDocumentPdf({ kind, … })`. Kinds: `enquiry`, `quotation`, `proposal`, `booking_confirmation`, `invoice`, `deposit_receipt`, `payment_receipt`, `paid_in_full`. |
| [client-enquiry-document-pdf.mjs](mdc:server/client-enquiry-document-pdf.mjs) | Admin desk letters / quotes / invoices / receipts with pricing tables (same letterhead). |

**Stakeholder sample** (two pages: letterhead + form/quote excerpt, then longer copy):

- File: `public/samples/golfsol-unified-document-template.pdf`
- Generator: `buildGsolUnifiedPdfTemplateSampleBytes()` — run `npm run generate:unified-pdf-sample`
- Browser preview: **`/unified-pdf-sample`**

## Shared branding and assets

- **Colours + WinAnsi safety**: [pdf-email-brand.mjs](mdc:server/pdf-email-brand.mjs) exports `pdfEmailTheme`, `brandedPdfAssetPaths` (logo PNG, fleet plate).
- **Helvetica text**: always run user-facing strings through **`sanitizeStandardFontText`** from [shared/pdf-winansi-sanitize.mjs](mdc:shared/pdf-winansi-sanitize.mjs) before `pdf-lib` `drawText`.

